WEBVTT

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.776
But then, something happened,
something small.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.896
I got a text from my boss,
it wasn't long, it just said,

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:05.456
"Wow, Cosmo!"

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.015
With a link to an article
that had just gone up about me.

00:02:09.039 --> 00:02:11.936
And it let me put that little,
scared voice away

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:14.456
and just be excited
about this whole new world,

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:16.176
rather than freaked out.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.776
That's the power of one person,

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:22.136
sometimes all it takes is one ally
to make you feel comfortable.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.256
And my coworkers
started acting differently.

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.776
They became more open,
more playful with me,

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:29.016
it was as if knowing this other side of me

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:31.776
gave them permission
to be more of themselves as well.